  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-financing handmade footwear in Cambodia for 2025 stock to the US.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With working capital from DGGF Pre-finance KOW Lifestyle Europe BV will be able to prefinance the purchase of products (handmade footwear) for the US market.

To complement their growth ambition in the US it is essential to expand the volume of available stock in the US market. 

With equity investments the production facility in Cambodia has been prepared for growth to match their planned sales and marketing activities. They now have enough space to expand their team and production capacity.

In line with the increase of production capacity, they will need to increase the purchase of raw materials as well as the shipping budget.</narrative>
  </description>
